---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="锦乃｜关于｜日本文化、历史与城郭创作者"
  description="关于锦乃的世界观。锦乃以历史文献、古照片、古地图及现存设计图等资料为基础，通过我的世界制作和还原日本传统建筑、城堡、御殿、武家宅邸与历史街景。"
>

<!-- Hero Image -->

<section class="relative h-[820px] overflow-hidden">

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 639px)"
      srcset="/images/about-bg-mobile.png"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/about-bg.png"
      alt="关于这个世界"
      class="about-image absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover select-none pointer-events-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>

  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div
    class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-20 flex flex-col items-center"
  >

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>

<div class="relative overflow-hidden">

  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg1.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/30"></div>


<!-- About -->

<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-32">

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8">

    <div class="max-w-7xl">

      <p class="scroll-fade delay-1 mb-4 tracking-[0.45em] text-base text-white">
        ABOUT
      </p>

      <h1
        class="scroll-fade delay-2 text-3xl font-light leading-tight text-white"
        style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
      >
        关于这个世界
      </h1>

      <p
        class="scroll-fade delay-3 mt-10 text-base leading-8 text-white"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >

        我常常会想，<br><br>

        过去的街道究竟是什么样的景色呢？<br>
        如果能够走在那里，又会感受到怎样的空气与氛围呢？<br><br>

        正是出于这样朴素的憧憬，我开始亲手制作那些拥有历史的建筑与街景。日本城堡、御殿、城下町、神社、武家宅邸、庭园……<br><br>

      </p>


      <div class="mt-10 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_380px]">

        <p
          class="scroll-fade delay-1 text-base leading-8 text-white"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          我一边查阅古照片、古地图、历史文献以及现存的设计图，<br>
          一点一点地还原当时的空间。<br><br>

          研究得越深入，发现的东西也越多。<br>
          建筑的结构、人们曾经的生活，<br>
          以及在那里孕育的文化所蕴含的深度，<br>
          都让我越来越着迷。<br><br>

          这是一个可以一起享受这样的心情的世界：<br>
          “真想亲自走进那样的景色，即使它在现实中无法实现。”

        </p>


        <a
          href="/zh-cn/works/"
          class="scroll-fade delay-2 group block overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]"
        >

          <img
            src="/images/works-preview.png"
            alt="作品一览"
            class="h-[360px] w-full object-cover transition duration-700 ease-out group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:scale-105"
          />

        </a>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- Content -->

<section class="relative py-32">

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8">

    <div class="space-y-32">


      <!-- PLAY STYLE -->

<article
  class="scroll-fade delay-1 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"
>

  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]">

    <img
      src="/images/edocastle2.png"
      alt="玩法"
      class="w-full aspect-video object-cover transition duration-700 ease-out hover:scale-105"
    />

  </div>


  <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/20 bg-black/20 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm lg:p-10">

    <p class="text-base tracking-[0.35em] text-white">
      ⋆﻿˙𝓹𝓵𝓪𝔂 𝓼𝓽𝔂𝓵𝓮˙⋆﻿
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-4 text-3xl text-white"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      玩法
    </h2>

    <p
      class="mt-8 text-base leading-8 text-white"
      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >

      平时我主要以日本建筑为中心进行各种创作与建造。<br>
      经常一不注意就打开了我的世界，有时甚至会从早上一直玩到深夜，一整天都沉浸其中。<br><br>

      虽然我有时会称自己为“日式建筑玩家”，但这只是因为过去制作的作品中日式建筑比较多而已。实际上，我并没有特别拘泥于某一种类型！<br><br>

      随心所欲地制作自己想到的东西，才是我最喜欢的玩法。

    </p>

  </div>

</article>


<!-- BUILDING -->

<article
  class="scroll-fade delay-2 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"
>

  <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]">

    <img
      src="/images/2026-08-06_18.12.23.jpg"
      alt="创作类型"
      class="w-full aspect-video object-cover transition duration-700 ease-out hover:scale-105"
    />

  </div>


  <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/20 bg-black/20 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm lg:p-10">

    <p class="text-base tracking-[0.35em] text-white">
      ⋆﻿˙𝓫𝓾𝓲𝓵𝓭𝓲𝓷𝓰˙⋆﻿
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-4 text-3xl text-white"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      创作类型
    </h2>

    <p
      class="mt-8 text-base leading-8 text-white"
      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >

      以历史资料、古照片及建筑图纸为基础的日本传统建筑<br><br>

      ・日本城堡<br>
      ・御殿、武家宅邸<br>
      ・神社、寺院、佛教建筑<br>
      ・日本庭园<br>
      ・城下町、宿场町<br>
      ・传统民居、町屋<br>
      ・江户时代的街景<br><br>

      从这些历史空间的忠实复原与再现，<br><br>

      ・船舶等交通工具<br>
      ・奇幻、欧美风格建筑<br>
      ・现代建筑<br>
      ・风景<br>
      ・角色<br>
      ・插画<br><br>

      到这些不同领域，我都不局限于特定类型，广泛地将各种想法变成作品。

    </p>

  </div>

</article>


<!-- LINK -->

<article
  class="scroll-fade delay-3 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"
>

  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]">

    <img
      src="/images/neko.jpg"
      alt="社交媒体"
      class="w-full aspect-video object-cover transition duration-700 ease-out hover:scale-105"
    />

  </div>


  <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/20 bg-black/20 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm lg:p-10">

    <p class="text-base tracking-[0.35em] text-white">
      ⋆﻿˙𝓵𝓲𝓷𝓴˙⋆﻿
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-4 text-3xl text-white"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      社交媒体
    </h2>


    <div
      class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base text-white"
      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >

      <div>

        <p class="text-base leading-7 text-white">

          我会分享创作过程、建筑摄影、<br>
          Minecraft作品，以及日常活动的最新动态。

        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="border-t border-white/30 pt-6 text-base break-all space-y-3">

        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/@NISHIKINO_Official"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block text-white hover:underline"
        >
          ♦️
          <span class="text-white">
            YouTube（@NISHIKINO_Official）
          </span>
        </a>


        <a
          href="https://x.com/nishikinolab"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block text-white hover:underline"
        >
          🐦
          <span class="text-white">
            X（NishikinoLab）
          </span>
        </a>


        <a
          href="https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/nishikinolab/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block text-white hover:underline"
        >
          🌏
          <span class="text-white">
            PlanetMinecraft（nishikinolab）
          </span>
        </a>


        <a
          href="https://www.tiktok.com/@nishikino_official"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block text-white hover:underline"
        >
          🎸
          <span class="text-white">
            TikTok（@nishikino_official）
          </span>
        </a>


        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/nishikinolab_official/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block text-white hover:underline"
        >
          📸
          <span class="text-white">
            Instagram（nishikinolab_official）
          </span>
        </a>


        <a
          href="https://www.pixiv.net/users/72809287"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block text-white hover:underline"
        >
          🎨
          <span class="text-white">
            Pixiv（users/72809287）
          </span>
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</article>


    </div>

  </div>

</section>

</div>


<style>

.about-image{
  animation:aboutFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  transform-origin:center;
}

@keyframes aboutFloat{

0%{
transform:translateY(0) scale(1.05);
}

50%{
transform:translateY(-15px) scale(1.08);
}

100%{
transform:translateY(0) scale(1.025);
}

}


/* ---------------- Scroll Animation ---------------- */

.scroll-fade{

opacity:0;

transform:
translateY(70px)
scale(.96);

transition:
opacity .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),
transform .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);

will-change:transform,opacity;

}

.scroll-fade.show{

animation:aboutBounce .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) forwards;

}

.delay-1{
transition-delay:0ms;
}

.delay-2{
transition-delay:140ms;
}

.delay-3{
transition-delay:280ms;
}

@keyframes aboutBounce{

0%{

opacity:0;

transform:
translateY(70px)
scale(.96);

}

65%{

opacity:1;

transform:
translateY(-10px)
scale(1.02);

}

100%{

opacity:1;

transform:
translateY(0)
scale(1);

}

}


:global(html) {
  color-scheme: light;
}

:global(body) {
  color-scheme: light;
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
}


:global(#about) {
  color-scheme: light;
}


/* ABOUT text */

section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 p.text-white {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* 世界観について */

section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 h1 {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* Introduction body */

section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 > div > div > p {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* Content */

section.relative.py-32 article {
  color-scheme: light;
  forced-color-adjust: none;
  -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
}


/* Content headings */

section.relative.py-32 article h2 {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* Content category labels */

section.relative.py-32 article > div:last-child > p:first-child {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* Content main text */

section.relative.py-32 article p {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* SNS links */

section.relative.py-32 article a {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* SNS URL */

section.relative.py-32 article a span.text-neutral-500 {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* SNS divider */

section.relative.py-32 article .border-t {
  border-color: #ffffff !important;
}


@media (max-width: 639px) {

  /* Hero / About text */

  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 p.text-white,
  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 h1,
  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 > div > div > p {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* Content */

  section.relative.py-32 article {
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* Content headings */

  section.relative.py-32 article h2 {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* Content text */

  section.relative.py-32 article p {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* SNS links */

  section.relative.py-32 article a {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: ffffff;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* SNS URL */

  section.relative.py-32 article a span.text-neutral-500 {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* SNS divider */

  section.relative.py-32 article .border-t {
    border-color: #ffffff !important;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }

}

</style>


<script>

const observer=new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{

entries.forEach((entry)=>{

if(entry.isIntersecting){

entry.target.classList.add("show");

observer.unobserve(entry.target);

}

});

},{
threshold:.18,
rootMargin:"0px 0px -8% 0px"
});

document.querySelectorAll(".scroll-fade").forEach((el)=>{

observer.observe(el);

});

</script>

</Layout>